      "index": "a029",
      "version": 1,
      "text": "\u2022 Check() \u2192 ModuleInfo\n\u2022 FindLatestMajor(): Parallel candidate probe \u26a1\n\u2022 latestVersion(): singleflight \ud83d\udd01 + sync.Map\n\u2022 fetchFromProxy(): Exponential backoff retry \ud83d\udd04\n\u2022 GOPROXY multi-url fallback & privateMatcher\n\u2022 GOPRIVATE & GONOPROXY prefix matching\n\u2022 Memory limit (10MB) & SafeCheckRedirect \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f",
