      "index": "a066",
      "version": 1,
      "text": "\u2022 ConcurrencyLimit: 100 (Engine/Checker)\n\u2022 HTTPTimeout: 10s | MaxRetries: 3\n\u2022 DefaultMaxProbe: 5 | MaxAllowed: 50\n\u2022 HTTPMaxIdleConns / PerHost: 100\n\u2022 ProxyResponseMaxBytes: 10 MB\n\u2022 GitHubModMaxBytes: 5 MB",
