      "text": "\u2022 spf13/cobra (CLI command routing)\n\u2022 spf13/viper (Config file parsing)\n\u2022 fatih/color (ANSI terminal colors)\n\u2022 cenkalti/backoff/v7 (Retry logic)\n\u2022 golang.org/x/mod (Module/semver parsing)\n\u2022 golang.org/x/sync (errgroup/singleflight)\n\u2022 golang.org/x/text (Unicode visualLen)\n\u2022 go.yaml.in/yaml/v3 (Report format)",
      "originalText": "\u2022 spf13/cobra (CLI command routing)\n\u2022 spf13/viper (Config file parsing)\n\u2022 fatih/color (ANSI terminal colors)\n\u2022 cenkalti/backoff/v7 (Retry logic)\n\u2022 golang.org/x/mod (Module/semver parsing)\n\u2022 golang.org/x/sync (errgroup/singleflight)\n\u2022 golang.org/x/text (Unicode visualLen)\n\u2022 go.yaml.in/yaml/v3 (Report format)",
