      "index": "a098",
      "version": 1,
      "text": "\u26a1 = Concurrent (errgroup, limit 100)\n\ud83d\udd01 = Singleflight request coalescing\n\ud83d\udd04 = Exponential backoff retry (3 tries)\n\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f = Memory bounds & token host scoping\n\ud83d\udcca = Thread-safe atomic progress tracking\n\ud83d\udcc4 = Safe atomic temp file write",
      "originalText": "\u26a1 = Concurrent (errgroup, limit 100)\n\ud83d\udd01 = Singleflight request coalescing\n\ud83d\udd04 = Exponential backoff retry (3 tries)\n\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f = Memory bounds & token host scoping\n\ud83d\udcca = Thread-safe atomic progress tracking\n\ud83d\udcc4 = Safe atomic temp file write",
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "lineHeight": 1.35,
      "autoResize": true
